      "question": "Why did Nanami use Collapse against Mahito?",
      "subject": "Collapse",
      "tier": "wiki",
      "expect_mode": "qa",
      "answer": [
        {
          "item": "Nanami first used Collapse to bring his first jujutsu battle with Mahito to an end. He was unable to effectively injure Mahito's body with Ratio Technique, so he decided he had to bring the fight to a close with one decisive blow.",
