      "question": "How did Nanami activate Collapse to end the fight with Mahito?",
      "subject": "Collapse",
      "tier": "wiki",
      "expect_mode": "qa",
      "answer": [
        {
          "item": "After using his Overtime binding vow to increase his cursed energy, Nanami activated Collapse and punched the wall of their underground battlefield. Streaks of cursed energy caused the wall to crumble to pieces, dropping all of the debris on Mahito.",
